---
Compare the requested deviation and retained safeguards with the precedent's actual rationale. Separate outcome similarity from reason similarity. Name the limiting circumstance that could reverse the analogy: event scope, beneficiary eligibility, timing, authority, risk or continuing control. Include explicit denial/expiry as a boundary fact. Return only rationale allowed by the reviewer's evidenced access; unsupported public summaries cannot reveal protected source details.
